{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You are an SCP Foundation security guard assigned to Site-8182 beneath an old Japanese mansion.<br>Your task was simple \u2014 guard\u2026</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Until SCP-9779-JP broke free. Now, unable to leave the underground laboratories and the mansion above them, you must gain D-level clearance and return the entity to its containment chamber before it destroys you.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Game Features:</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><u>Psychological Horror</u></strong> \u2013 tension, fear, and the struggle for survival.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><u>Puzzles</u></strong> \u2013 solve riddles to unlock new paths, access resources, and get closer to returning SCP-9779-JP to its chamber.<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3727440/extras/7c45b810392e072a63a5084d021be3e1.poster.avif?t=1759273017\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3727440/extras/7c45b810392e072a63a5084d021be3e1.webm?t=1759273017\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3727440/extras/7c45b810392e072a63a5084d021be3e1.mp4?t=1759273017\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3727440/extras/ba90b03c34cfe5603cd3639e3ad3b52f.poster.avif?t=1759273017\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3727440/extras/ba90b03c34cfe5603cd3639e3ad3b52f.webm?t=1759273017\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3727440/extras/ba90b03c34cfe5603cd3639e3ad3b52f.mp4?t=1759273017\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><u>Unique SCP Object</u></strong> \u2013 SCP-9779-JP drives its victims insane, cannot be detected by radar or technology, and can only be seen with the naked eye.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><u>Inventory and Notes</u></strong> \u2013 collect items and uncover documents with information about SCP-9779-JP.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><u>Survival and Stealth</u></strong> \u2013 hide, run, and find a way to return SCP to its chamber.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><u>Large Location</u></strong> \u2013 a traditional Japanese house with SCP underground laboratories.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><u>Story and Suspense</u></strong> \u2013 you are just a guard caught in a disaster. Doing the impossible is your only chance to survive.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Return the entity to its chamber \u2014 or become the next victim of SCP-9779-JP.</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3727440?t=1759273017","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3727440?t=1759273017","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3727440/1370757043bdbedc8b8c59a93faecb3e47f77284/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1759273017","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3727440/1370757043bdbedc8b8c59a93faecb3e47f77284/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1759273017","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You are an SCP Foundation security guard assigned to Site-8182 beneath an old Japanese mansion.<br>Your task was simple \u2014 guard\u2026</p><p class=\"bb_parag