t be detected by radar or technology, and can only be seen with the naked eye.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><u>Inventory and Notes</u></strong> \u2013 collect items and uncover documents with information about SCP-9779-JP.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><u>Survival and Stealth</u></strong> \u2013 hide, run, and find a way to return SCP to its chamber.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><u>Large Location</u></strong> \u2013 a traditional Japanese house with SCP underground laboratories.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><u>Story and Suspense</u></strong> \u2013 you are just a guard caught in a disaster. Doing the impossible is your only chance to survive.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Return the entity to its chamber \u2014 or become the next victim of SCP-9779-JP.</p>","developers":["Bipolarsoft"],"genres":[{"description":"Action","id":"1"},{"description":"Adventure","id":"25"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3727440/c80ca71492d8add3c81e242830e70246fc990c78/header.jpg?t=1759273017","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":[],"mac_requirements":[],"movies":[{"dash_av1":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3727440/534164104/0492705d85b5013b7463dba4958c31953f66d3d1/1756030280/dash_av1.mpd?t=1756829022","dash_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3727440/534164104/0492705d85b5013b7463dba4958c31953f66d3d1/1756030280/dash_h264.mpd?t=1756829022","highlight":true,"hls_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3727440/534164104/0492705d85b5013b7463dba4958c31953f66d3d1/1756030280/hls_264_master.m3u8?t=1756829022","id":257187901,"mp4":{"480":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257187901/movie480.mp4?t=1756829022","max":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257187901/movie_max.mp4?t=1756829022"},"name":"Teaser #1","thumbnail":"https://shared.aka